  * Version 0.18.0: omx_clap_host_offer_gui joins the OMX_CLAP_CORE_0.18 node
    (#180)
  * docs: a plugin's own window in omx-clap-host (#180)
  * ci: build with xcb and run test-jack-window; the packages require libxcb
    (#180)
  * tests: the window fixture and make test-jack-window (#180)
  * host: a plugin's own window over clap.gui and X11, on request (#180)
  * data: the codes of the window dimension, hosting.window.* (#180)
  * core: omx_clap_host_offer_gui hands a plugin the caller's clap.gui (#180)

